   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "260"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "16",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1650503718259884033",
  "id_str": "1650503723351678979",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1650503723351678979",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1650503718259884033",
  "created_at": "Mon Apr 24 14:15:27 +0000 2023",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "Brazil's \"Digital Real\" will be launched by 2024. It's a hard deadline because that's when the Central Bank's president term ends and he made that his top priority. With Pix and open Finance already launched, he wants to make sure his legacy is digitalization.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1650503729747992580"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2023-04-24T14:45:28.000Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": false
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "234"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "9",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1650503723351678979",
  "id_str": "1650503729747992580",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1650503729747992580",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1650503723351678979",
  "created_at": "Mon Apr 24 14:15:28 +0000 2023",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "How does it work? Well it's a sort of compromise that is not intended to be revolutionary, rather it's purposefully built to make sure that it is welcomed by the same players of the current system. It's pragmatic, but also innovative.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1650503732323315712"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2023-04-24T14:45:29.000Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": false
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "275"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "16",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1650503729747992580",
  "id_str": "1650503732323315712",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1650503732323315712",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1650503729747992580",
  "created_at": "Mon Apr 24 14:15:29 +0000 2023",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "The goal is NOT to have end users have a digital wallet, but rather focused on financial institutions. It would use Hyperledger Besu (a Consensys developed Ethereum implementation for private networks) to act as a the famous \"settlement layer\" between financial institutions.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1650503735028613121"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2023-04-24T14:45:29.000Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": false
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "201"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "12",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1650503732323315712",
  "id_str": "1650503735028613121",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1650503735028613121",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1650503732323315712",
  "created_at": "Mon Apr 24 14:15:29 +0000 2023",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "It would be a PoA network: the Central Bank would basically issue licenses to run validator nodes, but it's open to issue those licenses to any bank, fintech and even other civil society organizations.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1650505590744002569"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2023-04-24T14:52:52.000Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": false
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "274"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "18",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1650503735028613121",
  "id_str": "1650505590744002569",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1650505590744002569",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1650503735028613121",
  "created_at": "Mon Apr 24 14:22:52 +0000 2023",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "It has a strong focus on privacy, but not like you expect: since banks are running it, they want to make sure their own transactions are shielded from other banks.\n\nIt means all transactions are private and if the government wants your data it must get it via a court order.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
 {
  "edit_info": {
   "initial": {
    "editTweetIds": [
     "1650505593184976903"
    ],
    "editableUntil": "2023-04-24T14:52:52.000Z",
    "editsRemaining": "5",
    "isEditEligible": false
   }
  },
  "retweeted": false,
  "source": "<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>",
  "entities": {
   "hashtags": [],
   "symbols": [],
   "user_mentions": [],
   "urls": []
  },
  "display_text_range": [
   "0",
   "273"
  ],
  "favorite_count": "9",
  "in_reply_to_status_id_str": "1650505590744002569",
  "id_str": "1650505593184976903",
  "in_reply_to_user_id": "10157",
  "truncated": false,
  "retweet_count": "0",
  "id": "1650505593184976903",
  "in_reply_to_status_id": "1650505590744002569",
  "created_at": "Mon Apr 24 14:22:52 +0000 2023",
  "favorited": false,
  "full_text": "The goal is to replicate the same legal structure of the current system, just more efficiently. There is no \"government controlled button\" on the people's wallets – at least not any more than they have today.\n\nBut the interesting, is really how it enables NEW applications.",
  "lang": "en",
  "in_reply_to_screen_name": "avsa",
  "in_reply_to_user_id_str": "10157"
 },
